  "about": {
    "lead": "The person behind the terminal.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "I've been hands-on with computers for as long as I can remember, from modding my favourite games in my young teen years, tearing apart websites and applications in my mid-teens, freelance web development in 2007, through helpdesk, networking and cyber security, to engineering platforms today.",
      "Outside of work I'm happiest building things: programming side projects, reverse engineering, a homelab that's grown into a small rack, and old hardware and retro consoles like the Commodore 64 in this photo. Retro machines are a reminder that every abstraction we use today was once a few lines of Assembly or, in this case, BASIC."
    ],
